"store を使います\n"

#: src/cli.c:2342
msgid ""
"  KEY / KEYREF: logical secret name, optionally qualified as [/ABSOLUTE/"
"DOMAIN/]KEY[:STORE]\n"
msgstr ""
"  KEY / KEYREF: 論理的な secret 名です。必要なら [/ABSOLUTE/DOMAIN/]KEY[:"
"STORE] で修飾できます\n"

#: src/cli.c:2343
